{{- /*
The next= member of the watch's handle: the bounded read the law waits on.
The member's shape is held by the compile gate in the armed package — the
stamp names the method, the law's field declares what it must look like.
*/ -}}
{{- define "model.lawfield.MemberNext" -}}
{{ .Name }}: func(w {{ renderType .Out }}, timeout {{ renderExpr (external "time" "Duration") }}) ({{ renderType .Value }}, bool) {
			return w.{{ .KeyField }}(timeout)
		}
{{- end -}}
